WEBVTT

00:05:29.276 --> 00:05:30.996
and now it can’t burn away.

00:05:31.876 --> 00:05:34.636
Now, it turns out that biochar
is very good for soils.

00:05:35.196 --> 00:05:38.716
In fact, Indigenous people in the Amazon
have been using it for generations

00:05:38.716 --> 00:05:40.476
to improve the quality of their soil.

00:05:40.516 --> 00:05:42.756
We can do that on a much bigger scale,

00:05:42.756 --> 00:05:44.076
improve the soil

00:05:44.076 --> 00:05:45.076
and lock up carbon.

00:05:45.076 --> 00:05:46.436
That’s nature

00:05:46.436 --> 00:05:47.956
and technology

00:05:47.956 --> 00:05:49.516
and Indigenous wisdom,

00:05:49.516 --> 00:05:52.316
all in one sweet package.

00:05:53.036 --> 00:05:55.996
Now you can use technology as well ...

00:05:55.996 --> 00:05:57.916
to speed up natural processes.

00:05:58.396 --> 00:05:59.396
So this is basalt.

00:05:59.396 --> 00:06:00.436
It’s a volcanic rock.